-- Each states a property of the printed words and the record says it does not hold; the notes beside each give the numbers. Nothing here is edited to make it pass.

§ `I1: the numbers cited in the definition lie inside a range that the amending regulations cancel`

-- 1. The rule 143 that the definition cites lies outside every range that regulation 2 of the amending regulations cancels (it lies inside 1 of the 3 ranges, 132 to 258).
#ASSERT `the rule cited lies outside every one of the ranges` (`cited rule: 143 in the definition of the pre-trial session`) (`the ranges that regulation 2 cancels`)
-- 2. The rule 214 (base number of 214יא) that the definition cites lies outside every one of the ranges (it lies inside the same range, 132 to 258).
#ASSERT `the rule cited lies outside every one of the ranges` (`cited rule: 214 with a letter after it, in the same definition`) (`the ranges that regulation 2 cancels`)

§ `I2: the 2021 citation names a subsection by a label that the consolidation does not print`

-- 3. The consolidation prints a subsection of s 83 under the label "3" that the citing words give (it prints 0 under that label; it prints the labels (א) and (ב)).
#ASSERT `the consolidation prints a subsection under the label the citing words give` (`power citation: KT 9735 cites 83(3)`)
-- 4. The citation resolves to what the consolidation prints (it does not, by the label as written).
#ASSERT `the citation resolves to what the consolidation prints` (`power citation: KT 9735 cites 83(3)`)

§ `I3: the 2013 notice prints two figures for the threshold of items 8 and 22`

-- 5. The two items print the same figure beside the word that opens the threshold (23,800,859 against 23,880,859: they differ by 80,000).
#ASSERT `the two items print the same figure` (`threshold: item 8 of the 2013 notice, KT 7199 p. 400`) (`threshold: item 22 of the 2013 notice, KT 7199 p. 401`)

§ `I4: the 2021 notice prints an amount beside an item that the suspension treats as cancelled on the notice's publication day`

-- 6. The notice prints no amount for an item treated as cancelled on its publication day (it prints the amount 36 beside item 36; the notice was published 17 January 2021, inside the period 12 January to 20 July 2021).
#ASSERT `the notice prints no amount for an item treated as cancelled on its publication day` (`item 36 as the 2021 notice prints it, KT 9099 p. 1565`) (`suspension: KT 9089 p. 1524`)
